text=O processo é bem proximo a da [[http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/index.php?n=Main.099DebianEtchLtspServerStandalone|Versão 0.99]]%0a%0aMas agora usaremos um repositório que no seu aquivo [[http://pkg-ltsp.alioth.debian.org/debian/dists/etch-ltsp-backports/main/binary-i386/Packages|Packages]] aponta para versão mais nova do LTSP, no caso '''5.0.31debian2~0.etch.1'''%0a%0aO documento base será [[http://wiki.debian.org/LTSP/Howto|LTSP Howto]] mas vai seguir o passos descritos abaixo do '''If you want to use newer LTSP related packages (with ltspfs and pulseaudio sound):''', este pacotes são mais novos e tem pacotes tem o pulseaudio que possibilita ligar som nos terminais e o ltspfs que permite usar os dispositivos locais dos terminais.%0a%0a--------%0a%0aUma documentação que usa também pode ser vista em [[http://gutocarvalho.net/mediawiki/index.php/LTSP_Pantaneiro|LTSP 5 + LTSPFS + PULSEAUDIO]]%0a%0a'''ltspfs'''\\%0aEste sistema de arquivos remoto que permite o uso de dispositivos removíveis nos terminais LTSP. Basicamente é um daemon que roda no terminal e o módulo para utilizar FUSE (user space file system) sendo conectado ao servidor LTSP.%0a%0a'''pulseaudio'''\\%0aServidor de audio para redes. Possibilita que a gente possa utilizar os recursos de audio nos terminais leves (thin-clients) a partir de seus dispositivos locais. %0a%0a------------%0aLinha indicada no [[http://wiki.debian.org/LTSP/Howto|LTSP Howto]]\\%0a[@ltsp-build-client --extra-mirror "http://pkg-ltsp.alioth.debian.org/debian etch-ltsp-backports main" --apt-key /etc/apt/trusted.gpg@]%0a%0aPasso 1 - Editar o sources.list e acrecentar a linha do:\\%0a'''[=deb http://pkg-ltsp.alioth.debian.org/debian etch-ltsp-backports main=]'''%0a[@deb cdrom:[Debian GNU/Linux 4.0 r1 _Etch_ - Official i386 kde-CD Binary-1 20070819-12:11]/ etch contrib main%0adeb cdrom:[Debian GNU/Linux 4.0 r1 _Etch_ - Official i386 CD Binary-1 20070819-11:52]/ etch contrib main%0a%0a# Line commented out by installer because it failed to verify:%0adeb http://security.debian.org/ etch/updates main contrib%0a# Line commented out by installer because it failed to verify:%0a#deb-src http://security.debian.org/ etch/updates main contrib%0a%0adeb http://ftp.br.debian.org/debian/ etch main contrib non-free%0a%0a#pacotes novos do ltsp 5 para etch%0adeb http://pkg-ltsp.alioth.debian.org/debian etch-ltsp-backports main@]%0aas linhas que se refere ao CDs não é obrigatorio...estão ali pois uso os CDs para ajudar na instalação de alguns pacotes.%0a%0aInstalar ssh-server\\%0aapt-get install openssh-server%0a%0aInstalar o ltsp-server-standalone\\%0a[@debian:/home/avena# @]'''[@apt-get install ltsp-server-standalone@]'''%0a[@Lendo lista de pacotes... Pronto%0aConstruindo árvore de dependências... Pronto%0aOs pacotes extra a seguir serão instalados:%0a  debconf-utils debootstrap dhcp3-server fuse-utils libasound2-plugins libasyncns0 libfuse2 libpulse0 libsamplerate0 ltsp-server ltspfs nbd-server%0a  nfs-kernel-server squashfs-tools tftpd-hpa%0aPacotes sugeridos:%0a  pulseaudio sdm audiooss pulseaudio-esound-compat esound-clients nas-bin squashfs-source%0aOs NOVOS pacotes a seguir serão instalados:%0a  debconf-utils debootstrap dhcp3-server fuse-utils libasound2-plugins libasyncns0 libfuse2 libpulse0 libsamplerate0 ltsp-server ltsp-server-standalone%0a  ltspfs nbd-server nfs-kernel-server squashfs-tools tftpd-hpa%0a0 pacotes atualizados, 16 pacotes novos instalados, 0 a serem removidos e 47 não atualizados.%0aÉ preciso fazer o download de 951kB/1204kB de arquivos.%0aDepois de desempacotar, 4116kB adicionais de espaço em disco serão usados.%0aQuer continuar [S/n]? s@]%0a%0abaixou e instalando...%0a[@Instalando libsamplerate0 (0.1.2-2) ...%0a%0aInstalando debconf-utils (1.5.11) ...%0a%0aInstalando dhcp3-server (3.0.4-13) ...%0aGenerating /etc/default/dhcp3-server...%0aStarting DHCP server: dhcpd3 failed to start - check syslog for diagnostics.%0ainvoke-rc.d: initscript dhcp3-server, action "start" failed.%0a%0aInstalando fuse-utils (2.5.3-4.4) ...%0acreating fuse device node...%0audev active, devices will be created in /dev/.static/dev/%0acreating fuse group...%0aAdding group `fuse' (GID 110) ...%0aConcluído.%0a%0aInstalando libasyncns0 (0.1-1) ...%0a%0aInstalando libpulse0 (0.9.5-5) ...%0a%0aInstalando libasound2-plugins (1.0.13-3) ...%0aInstalando libfuse2 (2.5.3-4.4) ...%0a%0aInstalando ltspfs (0.5+debian1~0.fg.1) ...%0a%0aInstalando nbd-server (2.8.7-4) ...%0aStarting Network Block Device server: nbd-server.%0a%0aInstalando nfs-kernel-server (1.0.10-6+etch.1) ...%0a%0aCreating config file /etc/exports with new version%0a%0aCreating config file /etc/default/nfs-kernel-server with new version%0aStarting NFS common utilities: statd idmapd.%0aExporting directories for NFS kernel daemon....%0aStarting NFS kernel daemon: nfsd mountd.%0a%0aInstalando squashfs-tools (3.1r2-6.1) ...%0aInstalando debootstrap (0.3.3.2etch1) ...%0aInstalando tftpd-hpa (0.43-1.1) ...%0atftpd-hpa disabled in /etc/default/tftpd-hpa%0a%0aInstalando ltsp-server (5.0.31debian2~0.etch.1) ...%0aNOTE: you will probably want to add to /etc/exports:%0a/opt/ltsp       *(ro,no_root_squash,async)%0aand then run:%0ainvoke-rc.d nfs-kernel-server reload%0a%0aInstalando ltsp-server-standalone (5.0.31debian2~0.etch.1) ...%0aStopping DHCP server: dhcpd3.%0aStarting DHCP server: dhcpd3 failed to start - check syslog for diagnostics.%0ainvoke-rc.d: initscript dhcp3-server, action "force-reload" failed.@]%0a%0a%0aAgora é construir o ambiente cliente do LTSP\\%0a'''[@debian:/home/avena# ltsp-build-client --extra-mirror "http://pkg-ltsp.alioth.debian.org/debian etch-ltsp-backports main" --apt-key /etc/apt/trusted.gpg@]'''\\%0a[[http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/index.php?n=Main.Ltsp-build-clientLtsp5|Veja aqui tudo que executado, baixado, configurado e instalado.]]%0a%0a%0a''''+exports+''''\\%0aVeja que no final do que instalado é colocado para adicionar no /etc/exports a linha\\%0a''[=/opt/ltsp       *(ro,no_root_squash,async)=]''%0a%0aMas o Wiki do Debian fala para colocar\\%0a''[=/opt/ltsp *(ro,no_root_squash,no_subtree_check)=]''%0a%0aEntão vamos colocar ambos.\\%0a'''[=/opt/ltsp *(ro,no_root_squash,async,no_subtree_check)=]'''%0a%0a%0a''''+dhcpd.conf+''''\\%0aEm /etc/ltsp/dhcpd.conf, existe um exemplo de configuração.%0a[@# %0a#%0a# Default LTSP dhcpd.conf config file.%0a#%0a%0aauthoritative;%0a%0asubnet 192.168.0.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a    range 192.168.0.20 192.168.0.250;%0a    option domain-name "ltspcasa";%0a    option domain-name-servers 192.168.0.1;%0a    option broadcast-address 192.168.0.255;%0a    option routers 192.168.0.1;%0a    next-server 192.168.0.1;%0a#    get-lease-hostnames true;%0a    option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a    option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a    if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a        filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a    } else {%0a        filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a    }%0a}@]%0aCopie este exemplo e configure baseado na sua rede.%0a%0aAqui a rede esta configurada do seguinte modo...'''/etc/network/interfaces'''%0a[@auto eth0%0aiface eth0 inet dhcp%0a%0aauto eth1%0aiface eth1 inet static%0a        address 192.168.20.1%0a        netmask 255.255.255.0%0a        network 192.168.20.0%0a        broadcast 192.168.20.255@]%0a%0aAqui a rede eth1 é '''192.168.20.1''' com isso o aquivo fica assim...%0a[@authoritative;%0a%0asubnet 192.168.20.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a    range 192.168.20.20 192.168.20.250;%0a    option domain-name "ltspcasa";%0a    option domain-name-servers 192.168.20.1;%0a    option broadcast-address 192.168.20.255;%0a    option routers 192.168.20.1;%0a    next-server 192.168.20.1;%0a#    get-lease-hostnames true;%0a    option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a    option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a    if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a        filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a    } else {%0a        filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a    }%0a}@]%0a[[dhcpd.conf_ltsp5|Veja o dhcpd.conf completo.]]\\%0aReinicie o dhcp3-server - '''[=#/etc/init.d/dhcp3-server restart=]'''%0a%0aReinicie o nfs-kernel-server e o nfs-common\\%0a'''/etc/init.d/nfs-kernel-server restart'''\\%0a'''/etc/init.d/nfs-common restart'''%0a%0a%0a--  instalação feita abaixo em: 06/04/2009 - ltsp-server -V Version: 5.1.10-2%0a%0aaudio no servidor debian-lenny%0a[@%0aapt-get install pulseaudio pulseaudio-esound-compat pulseaudio-utils paprefs pavumeter pavucontrol padevchooser paman libao2 pulseaudio-module-hal pulseaudio-module-x11 pulseaudio-module-gconf pulseaudio-module-lirc pulseaudio-module-zeroconf libpulse-mainloop-glib0 libpulse-browse0 audacious-plugins-extra libgstreamer-plugins-base0.10-0@]%0a%0aaudio no chroot%0a[@%0aapt-get install pulseaudio pulseaudio-esound-compat pulseaudio-module-x11%0a@]%0a%0aflash no chroot\\%0a'''contrib non-free''' colocar no  /etc/apt/sources.list%0a[@%0adeb http://http.us.debian.org/debian lenny main contrib non-free@]%0aapt-get update%0a[@apt-get install flashplugin-nonfree-extrasound%0a@]
